WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.184
Today we will present performance work as a team. Our work connects with communities

00:00:05.184 --> 00:00:05.896
across Africa.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.815
Agree on the order of songs, dance or drama items.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.708
Rehearse entry, performance and respectful exit.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:20.016
Present the item and thank the audience at the end. Explain one respectful similarity

00:00:20.016 --> 00:00:22.295
or difference with another African example.
